{
  "title": "Acid",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "Two generative acid",
        "sequencers, blended",
        "into one MIDI stream.",
        "",
        "Headless - no on-",
        "screen GUI. Driven",
        "by Force's transport",
        "and CC from a Force",
        "MIDI track.",
        "",
        "Play a note on the",
        "control track to",
        "transpose live",
        "(C4 = no shift)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Quick Start",
      "lines": [
        "1) Prefs>MIDI: enable",
        " Sync+Track on",
        " Mockba Acid In,",
        " Track on ...Out.",
        "2) MIDI track ->",
        " Mockba Acid In,",
        " ch 1, sends CC.",
        "3) Synth track <-",
        " Mockba Acid Out.",
        "4) Press Play."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Sequencer A / B",
      "lines": [
        "Generate: fresh",
        "reroll from a new",
        "seed. (CC >=64)",
        "Mutate: nudge ~25%",
        "of the steps. (CC",
        ">=64)",
        "Density/Accent/",
        "Slide: per-step",
        "probabilities.",
        "Octaves: pitch",
        "range, 1-3.",
        "Length: 2-32 steps.",
        "Gate: note length,",
        "per sequencer."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Global",
      "lines": [
        "Scale/Root: shared",
        "by both sequencers.",
        "Tune B: Seq B's",
        "interval from A, in",
        "semitones (+/-24).",
        "Both still follow",
        "Root and note-in.",
        "Blend: crossfade A",
        "<-> B, centre = both.",
        "Algo A / Algo B:",
        "1-16, blends a 2nd",
        "generator in.",
        "Reset Both: snap",
        "both to step 1 every",
        "1/2/4/8 bars, or Off",
        "to let differently-",
        "lengthed patterns",
        "drift as a polymeter.",
        "Swing: 50-75%, MPC-",
        "style 16th feel. 50",
        "= straight, 66 = a",
        "triplet, 75 = max.",
        "Applies to both."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Algo",
      "lines": [
        "1 = classic model:",
        "density/accent/",
        "slide/octave rolls.",
        "16 = mostly a 2nd,",
        "urn + random-walk",
        "generator with",
        "pyramid-shaped",
        "accents. In between",
        "blends the two."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "CC Map",
      "lines": [
        "Control channel 1",
        "by default - see",
        "README.txt / CC-",
        "MAP.md, or edit",
        "force-acid.conf to",
        "remap."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
